Package: nameparser
Title: Structured Parsing of Biological Scientific Names
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R:
    person("Markus", "Döring", email = "mdoering@gbif.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Parses biological scientific names into their structured
    components - genus, epithets, authorship, rank and nomenclatural code -
    through a binding to the 'Rust' port of the scientific name parser
    developed by the Global Biodiversity Information Facility ('GBIF').
    The binding is generated with 'extendr'.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/gbif/name-parser-rust
BugReports: https://github.com/gbif/name-parser-rust/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    tibble
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    jsonlite
Config/testthat/edition: 3
